---A component of an entity; its fields are read and written directly: `light.intensity = 2`.
---getComponent and addComponent return the component's own class (LightComponent, ...) for a
---literal name.
---@class AnyComponent
---@field [string] any

---Name, tag and active state of an entity.
---@class EntityInfoComponent
---@field name string
---@field tag string
---@field active boolean

---Position, rotation and scale relative to the parent.
---@class TransformComponent
---@field position Vec3
---@field rotation Quat The inspector shows it as Euler angles in degrees.
---@field scale Vec3

---Renders the scene from the entity, looking down its -Z axis.
---@class CameraComponent
---@field projection integer|"Perspective"|"Orthographic" Reads give the index: 0 Perspective, 1 Orthographic.
---@field fieldOfView number Degrees. From 1 to 179.
---@field orthographicSize number Half of the visible height in world units. From 0.01 to 10000.
---@field nearPlane number From 0.001 to 1000.
---@field farPlane number From 0.01 to 100000.
---@field primary boolean The game view renders the primary camera with the lowest priority.
---@field priority integer
---@field clearMode integer|"Skybox"|"Solid Color" Reads give the index: 0 Skybox, 1 Solid Color.
---@field clearColor Color

---Directional, point or spot light. Directional and spot lights point down -Z.
---@class LightComponent
---@field type integer|"Directional"|"Point"|"Spot" Reads give the index: 0 Directional, 1 Point, 2 Spot.
---@field color Color
---@field intensity number From 0 to 100000.
---@field range number From 0.01 to 10000.
---@field innerConeAngle number Degrees. From 0 to 89.
---@field outerConeAngle number Degrees. From 0 to 89.
---@field castShadows boolean Directional lights only.

---Draws a glTF/OBJ model or a built-in primitive with PBR materials.
---@class MeshRendererComponent
---@field mesh string Model file or builtin:cube, builtin:sphere, builtin:plane, builtin:cylinder, builtin:cone, builtin:torus, builtin:capsule Project-relative asset path (.gltf;.glb;.obj).
---@field material string Optional material that replaces all materials of the mesh. Project-relative asset path (.rmat).
---@field tint Color
---@field castShadows boolean
---@field visible boolean

---Draws a textured quad in the entity's XY plane.
---@class SpriteRendererComponent
---@field texture string Project-relative asset path (.png;.jpg;.jpeg;.bmp;.tga;.qoi;.gif).
---@field color Color
---@field size Vec2
---@field pivot Vec2
---@field sourceRect Vec4 Texture region in pixels (x, y, width, height); zero width uses the whole texture.
---@field flipX boolean
---@field flipY boolean
---@field sortingOrder integer
---@field visible boolean

---Draws text on the screen or in the world.
---@class TextRendererComponent
---@field text string
---@field font string Project-relative asset path (.ttf;.otf).
