---@field color Color
---@field alignment integer|"Left"|"Center"|"Right" Reads give the index: 0 Left, 1 Center, 2 Right.
---@field screenSpace boolean
---@field anchor Vec2 Screen-space anchor: (0,0) top-left, (1,1) bottom-right.
---@field sortingOrder integer
---@field visible boolean

